### Register User
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "changeme123"
}

### Login User
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "changeme123"
}